  "question": {
    "text": "The two ends of a rod of length $L$ and a uniform crosssectional area $A$ are kept at two temperatures $T_{1}$ and $\\mathrm{T}_{2}\\left(\\mathrm{~T}_{1}>\\mathrm{T}_{2}\\right)$. The rate of heat transfer, $\\frac{\\mathrm{dQ}}{\\mathrm{dt}}$ through the rod in a steady state is given by:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
